### Executable examples (VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP Client).
### Run the requests top to bottom; later ones reuse earlier responses.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@idempotencyKey = 6f1c2a52-6f0e-4f43-9a7e-2d3c7a1b0001

### List products (cursor paginated; filters: q, inStock)
# @name listProducts
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?limit=3&inStock=true

###
@productId = {{listProducts.response.body.data[0].id}}

### Create a cart
# @name createCart
POST {{baseUrl}}/carts

###
@cartId = {{createCart.response.body.id}}

### Add an item (adding the same product again merges into the line)
POST {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 2 }

### Change the quantity (absolute value)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}/items/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 3 }

### View the cart: live prices, subtotal, per-line availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}

### Check out. 201 the first time; repeating this exact request returns 200 + Idempotent-Replayed: true
# @name checkout
POST {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}/checkout
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
@orderId = {{checkout.response.body.id}}

### Retrieve the order snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### Same key, different body: 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}/checkout
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "couponCode": "SAVE-ABCDEFGH" }

### Remove an item (404 CART_ITEM_NOT_FOUND if absent; 409 CART_NOT_OPEN after checkout)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}/items/{{productId}}

### ---- Administrative operations ----

### Generate a coupon for the earliest unrewarded milestone (409 NO_ELIGIBLE_MILESTONE if none)
# @name generateCoupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/coupons

###
@couponCode = {{generateCoupon.response.body.code}}

### Check out with a coupon, and with a price guard: PRICE_CHANGED if the total differs
POST {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}/checkout
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2a52-6f0e-4f43-9a7e-2d3c7a1b0002
Content-Type: application/json

{ "couponCode": "{{couponCode}}", "expectedTotalMinor": 1000 }

### List coupons (filter: status=AVAILABLE|REDEEMED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/coupons?status=AVAILABLE&limit=20

### List orders, newest first (filters: from, to, couponCode)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders?limit=20

### Sales report (read-only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/sales
